{"ID":"20240118151015-3jocy3t","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151015-3jocy3t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151015-3jocy3t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151015-x8bgwg4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613092748-ylwe90e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151015-x8bgwg4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:57\u0026#125;","title":"285雚菌","type":"doc","updated":"20240613092748"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151015-x8bgwg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151015-x8bgwg4","updated":"20240122152738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名雚卢。味咸，平，有小毒。治心痛，温中，去长虫，白癣，蛲虫，蛇螫毒，症瘕，诸虫。生东海池泽及渤海。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152739-pgyz2hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152739-pgyz2hy"}},{"ID":"20240122152740-wo9toxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152740-wo9toxf","updated":"20240122152743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"285，这个雚菌呢没有人会用了，我们姑且知道有这么一味就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240613092748-ylwe90e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613092748-ylwe90e"}}]}